  <item>
    <title>🌈🌈🌈六一儿童节给华夏少年郎写首歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665b188f63c334a2fba2981f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665b188f63c334a2fba2981f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 12:48:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（钢琴前奏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（儿童歌唱，诗歌）</span></p><span></span><p><span>早上的阳光无比明媚祖国的花朵盛艳开放让我们快乐迎接早晨的太阳</span></p><span></span><p><span>（美声唱法）</span></p><span></span><p><span>壮哉我中国少年郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>（第1节，说唱，）</span></p><span></span><p><span>巍巍昆仑起山海泱泱华夏镇四方我见青山多妩媚，料青山见我应如是。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（桥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（儿童，合唱）风声雨声读书声,声声入耳，家事国事天下事,事事关心。吾华夏少年强，则吾中国强</span></p><span></span><p><span>（桥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（合唱，男声说唱）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你听，这朗朗读书声小时不识月，呼作白玉盘牧童骑黄牛，歌声振林樾。你看，这孜孜勤学影儿童散学归来早，忙趁东风放纸鸢。儿童急走追黄蝶，飞入菜花无处寻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（桥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（力量，时髦，诗句）</span></p><span></span><p><span>世界是我们的，可终究是你们的人不狂妄枉少年有梦就请大胆追希望你乘风追梦，未来可期装得下奇思妙想守得住浪漫天真</span></p><span></span><p><span>（桥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（尾声）</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是六一儿童节祝你们在祖国妈妈的怀里茁壮成长。我朝气蓬勃的华夏少年郎愿你童真永恒快乐成长不管几岁请快乐万岁因为你们是最可爱的小红星</span></p><span></span><p><span>（尾，完）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/Fmd5OzMuFDJZdvAgHKEnH0RPACah.m4a" length="2923320" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:04:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgxnAcqiP6XtBB5Xnl-1sonJlu8K.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《完美的日子》一首原创AI音乐，送给亲爱的同志们。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66585fc1ad5aa5d8c279d59c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66585fc1ad5aa5d8c279d59c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 11:15:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《完美日子》</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Intro)</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse1，Rap,)</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘿，我亲爱的同志。</span></p><span></span><p><span>请向着胜利前进。</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对漆黑的环境，</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑夜，是一份黑暗的礼物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>月亮，却是惊喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse2,Rap)</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要遗憾是真实的，</span></p><span></span><p><span>就是最完美的主义，</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你前进的道路上</span></p><span></span><p><span>所爱接欢喜，</span></p><span></span><p><span>山海皆可平。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Bridge,Rap)</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许，现在是以后，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以后是如果，</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果没有如果。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，现在是现在，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以后是以后。</span></p><span></span><p><span>保持自己的初衷才是正义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse3,Rap)</span></p><span></span><p><span>偶尔说的无心话，</span></p><span></span><p><span>总有人说像是诗 ，</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能用心的东西都太刻意，</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有新意，</span></p><span></span><p><span>又有点故意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之，接下来的生活就是</span></p><span></span><p><span>好好享受生活的每一天，无心最好</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Outro)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/Fno5cNERy3wfb-VXsNEFvlT54GCC.m4a" length="2301231" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:03:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgxnAcqiP6XtBB5Xnl-1sonJlu8K.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>520，给宝贝写一首快乐的歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664b5a3f251bd96e6c99f1fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664b5a3f251bd96e6c99f1fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 May 2024 14:12:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>(Verse 1)</span></p><span></span><p><span>关关雎鸠，在河之洲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>窈窕淑女，君子好逑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>蒹葭苍苍，白露为霜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所谓伊人，在水一方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>南方有佳人，一笑百媚生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>美丽可爱的笑容，犹如沐春风。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse 2)</span></p><span></span><p><span>红豆生南国，此物最相思。</span></p><span></span><p><span>朝思暮想的人呐，就在我的身边。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Bridge)</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘿，宝贝，为你写一首快乐的歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>让快乐一直伴随你，甜蜜入心底</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse 3)</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲亲我的宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span>送你一朵小花，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们手拉手一起漫步</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起去吹旷野的风</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起去看天边的云</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse 5)</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲亲我的宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span>送你一颗小星</span></p><span></span><p><span>你每个样子都是最美</span></p><span></span><p><span>快乐的笑容会让我沉醉</span></p><span></span><p><span>可爱的笑容会让我陶醉</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse 6)</span></p><span></span><p><span>就这样一直爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一秒都珍惜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘿，宝贝，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我好钟意你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Outro)</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲亲我的宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span>就这样爱你，爱你，爱你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一秒都珍惜。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/Fn_d0iH9pS_iY0s9yrYWNWwmPIcF.m4a" length="2087581" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:02:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvztHHGpI2OGwASPYe4Fusu0zPDN.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
