  <item>
    <title>牵挂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663a4f52dec649c5f5155a9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663a4f52dec649c5f5155a9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 May 2024 15:57:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>(Verse 1)</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经一起笑过的日子</span></p><span></span><p><span>如今变得遥远无比</span></p><span></span><p><span>岁月悄悄地走过</span></p><span></span><p><span>留下了回忆在心里</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Pre-Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论走到哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span>思念总会在心间徘徊</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然时间流逝</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们的情谊不会改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候天天见面的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大后要挤点时间才能见面</span></p><span></span><p><span>这或许是成人间的牵挂</span></p><span></span><p><span>但友谊却永远不会改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Verse 2)</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使路途遥远难行</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会一直牵挂着你的笑容</span></p><span></span><p><span>就算岁月悄悄流逝</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的情谊不会轻易消逝</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Pre-Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论走到哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span>思念总会在心间徘徊</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然时间流逝</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们的情谊不会改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候天天见面的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大后要挤点时间才能见面</span></p><span></span><p><span>这或许是成人间的牵挂</span></p><span></span><p><span>但友谊却永远不会改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Bridge)</span></p><span></span><p><span>岁月如梭，变化无常</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们的友谊依然长久</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论相隔多远，心依然相连</span></p><span></span><p><span>这份情谊永不褪色</span></p><span></span><p><span>(Chorus)</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候天天见面的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大后要挤点时间才能见面</span></p><span></span><p><span>这或许是成人间的牵挂</span></p><span></span><p><span>但友谊却永远不会改变</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/FlfOlgvqrwsaqHcxGvAMNYTgHpHf.m4a" length="2904598" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:02:00</itunes:duration>
